        85.3282241821289
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        94.06519317626953,
        526.5911865234375,
        107.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "Factors to consider when implementing moderate complexity automated NAATs for detection",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.979881286621094,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        108.06519317626953,
        373.1747131347656,
        121.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "of TB and resistance to rifampicin and isoniazid are as follows:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        127.81720733642578,
        78.81909942626953,
        140.9622039794922
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        127.81720733642578,
        526.9749755859375,
        140.9622039794922
      ],
      "text": "local epidemiological data on resistance prevalence should guide local testing algorithms,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        143.31719970703125,
        495.7494812011719,
        156.4622039794922
      ],
      "text": "whereas pretest probability is important for the clinical interpretation of test results;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        158.81719970703125,
        78.81909942626953,
        171.9622039794922
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        158.81719970703125,
        527.10546875,
        171.9622039794922
      ],
      "text": "the cost of a test varies depending on parameters such as the number of samples in a batch",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.996349334716797,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        174.31719970703125,
        493.5726623535156,
        187.4622039794922
      ],
      "text": "and the staff time required; therefore, a local costing exercise should be performed;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        189.81719970703125,
        78.81909942626953,
        202.9622039794922
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        189.81719970703125,
        526.9971313476562,
        202.9622039794922
      ],
      "text": "low, moderate and high complexity tests have successive increase in technical competency",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        205.31719970703125,
        501.8896179199219,
        218.4622039794922
      ],
      "text": "needs (qualifications and skills) and staff time, which affects planning and budgeting;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        220.81719970703125,
        78.81909942626953,
        233.9622039794922
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        220.81719970703125,
        526.9971923828125,
        233.9622039794922
      ],
      "text": "availability and timeliness of local support services and maintenance should be considered",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        236.31719970703125,
        214.4528045654297,
        249.4622039794922
      ],
      "text": "when selecting a provider;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        251.81719970703125,
        78.81909942626953,
        264.96221923828125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        251.81719970703125,
        526.88720703125,
        264.96221923828125
      ],
      "text": "laboratory accreditation and compliance with a robust quality management system",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        267.31719970703125,
        524.42724609375,
        280.46221923828125
      ],
      "text": "(including appropriate quality control) are essential for sustained service excellence and trust;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.81719970703125,
        78.81909942626953,
        295.96221923828125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        282.81719970703125,
        526.5972290039062,
        295.96221923828125
      ],
      "text": "training of both laboratory and clinical staff is needed to ensure effective delivery of services",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.979631423950195,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        298.31719970703125,
        179.09910583496094,
        311.46221923828125
      ],
      "text": "and clinical impact;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        313.81719970703125,
        78.81909942626953,
        326.96221923828125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        313.81719970703125,
        526.9412841796875,
        326.96221923828125
      ],
      "text": "use of connectivity solutions for communication of results is encouraged, to improve",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        329.31719970703125,
        418.0146484375,
        342.46221923828125
      ],
      "text": "efficiency of service delivery and reduce time to treatment initiation;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        344.81719970703125,
        78.81909942626953,
        357.96221923828125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        344.81719970703125,
        526.9973754882812,
        357.96221923828125
      ],
      "text": "moderate complexity automated NAATs may already be used programmatically for other",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        360.31719970703125,
        526.9862060546875,
        373.46221923828125
      ],
      "text": "diseases – for example, severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 (SARS-CoV2), HIV",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        375.81719970703125,
        527.0026245117188,
        388.96221923828125
      ],
      "text": "and antimicrobial resistance (AMR) – which could potentially facilitate implementation of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        391.31719970703125,
        237.99258422851562,
        404.46221923828125
      ],
      "text": "TB testing on shared platforms;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        406.81719970703125,
        78.81909942626953,
        419.96221923828125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        406.81719970703125,
        526.96435546875,
        419.96221923828125
      ],
      "text": "implementation of moderate complexity automated NAATs requires laboratories with the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        422.31719970703125,
        413.1534118652344,
        435.46221923828125
      ],
      "text": "required infrastructure, space and efficient sample referral systems;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.81719970703125,
        78.81909942626953,
        450.96221923828125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        437.81719970703125,
        526.9652709960938,
        450.96221923828125
      ],
      "text": "although these are automated tests, well-trained skilled staff are needed to set up assays",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        453.31719970703125,
        312.9812316894531,
        466.46221923828125
      ],
      "text": "and complete maintenance requirements; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        468.81719970703125,
        78.81909942626953,
        481.96221923828125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        468.81719970703125,
        526.964111328125,
        481.96221923828125
      ],
      "text": "implementation of these tests should be context specific; thus, it should take into account",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        484.31719970703125,
        526.876220703125,
        497.46221923828125
      ],
      "text": "access issues, especially in remote areas, where less centralized WHO-recommended",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
