        78.81909942626953,
        711.0463256835938,
        527.10302734375,
        724.1913452148438
      ],
      "text": "economic studies evaluating the costs, cost–effectiveness and cost–benefit of different",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        726.5463256835938,
        204.60838317871094,
        739.6913452148438
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic technologies;",
